					&lt;/tr&gt;
					&lt;tr&gt;
						&lt;td style="WORD-WRAP: break-word" width="20%"&gt; ВЭБ&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="WORD-WRAP: break-word" width="20%"&gt; 
