			&lt;p&gt; Дата: 
				&lt;a id="d8fb4cff-ca61-11e1-bd7f-906f442be8ad" href="about:"&gt;[...]&lt;/a&gt;         Врач: 
				&lt;a id="4ff6f6c0-a36a-11e3-9958-d43d7e553e20" href="about:"&gt;[...]&lt;/a&gt;
			&lt;/p&gt;
		&lt;/div&gt;
